<title>USA: Wedgestone says president resigns.</title>
<headline>Wedgestone says president resigns.</headline>
<dateline>IRWINDALE, Calif. 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wedgestone Financial Corp on Thursday said President Jeffrey Goldstein has resigned to pursue other opportunities.</p>
<p>He has been replaced by David Sharp, chief executive officer of the company's principal operating subsidiary, Wedgestone Automotive Corp.</p>
<p>Goldstein will continue to serve on the company's board of trustees, the company said in a statement.</p>
